From 76eadee28794daf5fe52c092aafcf33de9a94e73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 02:56:23 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] DL-151 edit-quests

Let the DM edit a quest's title and details.

Each quest on the Overview page gets an Edit control for the DM with the
same limits as adding (120-character title, 600 characters of details).
Editing never changes whether the quest is hidden or done, players
cannot edit, and another campaign's quest is a 404.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DygiEHS4J96y8JVcnoDwgr
